monolith-firewall (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Core service with CodeLogic 3.0 framework
  * Package loading and module registry with RCL support
  * WebUI with Bootstrap 5.3.8 and jQuery SPA
  * Named pipe IPC communication
  * CL.SQLite integration for database operations
  * User management module (monolith-system)
  * Package scanner and loader for dynamic package discovery

